        "collapsible_row_mTKLya": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Save 10% on Dining Sets Promotion",
            "row_content": "<ol><li><strong>Promotion Period</strong>: This offer is valid from Wednesday, 28 February at 00:01 AM to Wednesday, 10 April at 11:59 PM (GMT+8).</li><li><strong>Eligibility</strong>: The \"Save 10% on Dining Sets\" promotion is open to all customers of Island Living. Participants must be aged 18 years or over.</li><li><strong>Offer Details</strong>: Customers are entitled to a 10% discount on the total purchase price when they buy one (1) dining table and one (1) or more dining chairs in a single transaction.</li><li><strong>How to Participate</strong>: Simply purchase a dining table and 1 or more dining chairs to automatically receive 10% discount off your purchase when you add to cart.</li><li><strong>Exclusions</strong>: This offer cannot be combined with any other promotions, discounts or coupon codes. Discount is not applicable to previous purchases, gift card purchases, shipping charges, or taxes.</li><li><strong>Returns/Exchanges</strong>: Items purchased under this promotion can be returned or exchanged according to Island Living's standard return policy, except that the discount will be proportionally applied to any returned or exchanged items. </li><li><strong>Inventory</strong>: Offer is subject to availability and while stocks last. Island Living reserves the right to substitute any product with another of equivalent value without giving notice.</li><li><strong>Modification of Terms</strong>: Island Living reserves the right to cancel, modify or extend the promotion at any time without prior notice due to circumstances beyond its control.</li><li><strong>Liability</strong>: Island Living shall not be liable for any loss or damage arising from the participants' participation in the promotion, or from the participants' acceptance and/or use of the promotional discount.</li><li><strong>Privacy</strong>: By participating in this promotion, customers agree to the collection and use of their personal information in accordance with Island Living’s privacy policy.</li><li><strong>Governing Law</strong>: These terms and conditions are governed by the laws of the jurisdiction in which Island Living operates, without regard to its conflict of law principles.</li><li><strong>Inquiries</strong>: For any questions or concerns regarding the promotion or these terms and conditions, please contact Island Living: info@islandliving.sg</li></ol><p>By participating in the \"Mix, Match & Save\" promotion, customers are deemed to have read, understood, and agreed to be bound by these terms and conditions.</p>",
